@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@key = your-local-service-key
@task = replace-with-task-id
@token = replace-with-recovery-continuation-token
@history = replace-with-history-entry-id

### Classify/normalize only: no business model or tools are executed.
POST {{base}}/agent/tasks/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "recover-001", "kind": "Recover", "taskId": "{{task}}" }

### Read the classification and logical continuation token.
GET {{base}}/agent/tasks/{{task}}/recovery
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Continue exactly the inspected point; an obsolete token cannot advance again.
POST {{base}}/agent/tasks/commands?wait=false
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "resume-001", "kind": "Resume", "taskId": "{{task}}", "recoveryToken": "{{token}}" }

### Requires Context.Enabled and a settled waiting/paused boundary; costs are charged.
POST {{base}}/agent/tasks/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "compact-001", "kind": "CompactContext", "taskId": "{{task}}" }

### Inspect current memory/coverage without changing it.
GET {{base}}/agent/tasks/{{task}}/context
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Original audit history, independent of the model projection.
GET {{base}}/agent/tasks/{{task}}/history?limit=65536
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Bounded single-entry JSON fragment. Join Data using NextOffset, then verify ContentHash.
GET {{base}}/agent/tasks/{{task}}/history/{{history}}?offset=0&limit=1024
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Host must explicitly authorize trusted usage reconciliation; do not guess usage.
POST {{base}}/agent/tasks/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "usage-001", "kind": "ReconcileModelUsage", "taskId": "{{task}}",
  "modelUsage": {
    "invocationId": "replace-with-unknown-invocation-id",
    "usage": { "inputTokens": 100, "outputTokens": 20, "known": true },
    "basis": "replace-with-trusted-provider-receipt-or-host-approved-bound",
    "conservativeUpperBound": false
  }
}

### Observe background failures; acceptance is not proof of completion.
GET {{base}}/agent/tasks/{{task}}/failure
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
